to play with you guys.

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:07.640 align:start size:94% position:6%
This first one is
from @DanaHartley9.

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:11.344
Her resolution is to
"stop calling my husband 'bro.'"

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:12.412 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh, okay, yeah.

00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:14.014 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That's a...

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:14.514 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-"Hey, bro."

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:17.350 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Can you pick up
the kids from school, bro?"

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:19.452 line:92%
This one's from @Boggle1388.

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:22.055 align:start size:94% position:6%
His resolution is
"join the gym, never go."

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:24.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
There, that's his
five-word resolution.

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:26.459 size:75% position:38% line:92%
We've all done that.

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:28.661 line:92%
This one is from @JennyFromat.

00:00:28.661 --> 00:00:32.599
Her resolution is
"less upsetty, more spaghetti."

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:33.867 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hey!
-Yeah!

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:36.636 align:start size:94% position:6%
Me likey.
-That's a fantastic one.

00:00:36.636 --> 00:00:40.040 align:start size:94% position:6%
@JennyFromat -- "Less upsetty
and more spaghetti."

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:40.440 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:43.243
-That should be a T-shirt or
a bumper sticker or something.

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:46.613 line:92%
This one's from @Daveed23.

00:00:46.613 --> 00:00:50.483 align:start size:94% position:6%
His resolution is "stop
stepping on dumb-ass Legos."

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:52.619 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh.

00:00:52.619 --> 00:00:54.254 line:92%
This one's from @CuckooBear.

00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:57.891
His resolution is
"read more, menus don't count."

00:00:57.891 --> 00:00:59.459 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
There you go.

00:00:59.459 --> 00:01:03.596
The Cheesecake Factory --
that's kind of a book.

00:01:03.596 --> 00:01:06.666 line:92%
